    "body": "<h2 id=\"h_01J8G5DYZCHVAD027ZWEHB268A\">You will learn</h2>\n<p>Learn how to view and edit your business' industry and vertical in Klaviyo. Your Klaviyo account should always accurately reflect your business’ industry and vertical.  </p>\n<div class=\"bs-callout bs-callout-default\">\n<p>You can only update your industry or vertical 2 times every 30 days. </p>\n</div>\n<h2 id=\"h_01J8G5DYZCSVX4BYVM9D9N01RZ\">Access your industry and vertical</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>Select your organization name in the bottom left corner.</li>\n<li>Click <strong>Setting</strong>.<strong><br><img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/29464924234395\" alt=\"The Settings button being selected from the account menu in the bottom left corner of Klaviyo.\" width=\"275\" height=\"262\"><br></strong>\n</li>\n<li>Select<strong> Organization</strong> along the left-hand side menu.<br><img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/29464924251035\" alt=\"The Organization tab selected on the left-hand navigation of the Account settings page within Klaviyo.\">\n</li>\n<li>Scroll to the bottom of the page to the section on your <em>Industry information</em>.<br><img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/29464924267163\" alt=\"The Industry Information menu on the Organization settings page within Klaviyo showing where you can choose an Industry and Vertical for your account.\">\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"h_01J8G5DYZC6Y73Q62BG8EN246Z\">Change your industry</h3>\n<p>To change the industry associated with your account:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Click into the dropdown under <em>Industry</em> and select 1 of the following options:\n<ul>\n<li>Ecommerce, Apparel &amp; Accessories</li>\n<li>Ecommerce, Automotive</li>\n<li>Ecommerce, Electronics</li>\n<li>Ecommerce, Food &amp; Beverage</li>\n<li>Ecommerce, Hardware &amp; Home Improvement</li>\n<li>Ecommerce, Health &amp; Beauty</li>\n<li>Ecommerce, Home &amp; Garden</li>\n<li>Ecommerce, Jewelry</li>\n<li>Ecommerce, Mass Merchant</li>\n<li>Ecommerce, Office Supplies</li>\n<li>Ecommerce, Specialty</li>\n<li>Ecommerce, Sporting Goods</li>\n<li>Ecommerce, Toys &amp; Hobbies</li>\n<li>Non-Ecommerce\n<ul>\n<li>Agency, Marketing, and Consulting</li>\n<li>Banking, Finance, and Insurance</li>\n<li>Events &amp; Entertainment</li>\n<li>Education</li>\n<li>Travel</li>\n<li>Non-Profit</li>\n<li>Politics &amp; Government</li>\n<li>Real Estate &amp; Construction</li>\n<li>Restaurants</li>\n<li>Software / SaaS</li>\n<li>Telecommunications</li>\n<li>Travel</li>\n<li>Others</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>Click <strong>Save</strong> to update your information.</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"h_01J8G5DYZCYFEPZ38ZCFHAH50Z\">Change your vertical </h3>\n<p>You can only select a vertical if you are within 1 of the following ecommerce industries:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Apparel and accessories</li>\n<li>Electronics</li>\n<li>Health and beauty</li>\n<li>Home and garden</li>\n<li>Specialty</li>\n</ul>\n<p>To change the vertical:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Select the dropdown under <em>Vertical</em> and choose 1 of the following options:\n<ul>\n<li>For Ecommerce, Apparel &amp; Accessories:\n<ul>\n<li>Footwear</li>\n<li>Hats</li>\n<li>Activewear</li>\n<li>Fast Fashion</li>\n<li>Maternity and children's clothes</li>\n<li>Swimwear</li>\n<li>Other</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>For Ecommerce, Electronics:\n<ul>\n<li>Phone carriers</li>\n<li>Photography equipment and services</li>\n<li>Other</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>For Ecommerce, Health &amp; Beauty:\n<ul>\n<li>Skincare</li>\n<li>Haircare</li>\n<li>Fragrance</li>\n<li>Makeup</li>\n<li>Dental products</li>\n<li>Eyewear</li>\n<li>Fitness and wellness</li>\n<li>Supplements</li>\n<li>Other</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>For Ecommerce, Home &amp; Garden:\n<ul>\n<li>Bedding</li>\n<li>Furniture</li>\n<li>Other</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>Click <strong>Save</strong> to update  your information.</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"h_01J8G5DYZCQRAPHT7NH8YZQ2MM\">Additional resources</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/360047399472\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Getting started with reporting</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/360047725651\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">About custom reports in Klaviyo</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/15166435131163\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">How to change your account's organization name</a></li>\n</ul>",
    "user_segment_ids": []
